  "title": "TCS Q2 results: Net profit rises 15% to ₹13,884 crore, revenue up 11.2%",
  "summary": "TCS reported a 15% increase in net profit to ₹13,884 crore and a 11.2% growth in revenue to ₹73,188 crore in Q2FY27, driven by improved performance in its home and personal care business. Meanwhile, Info Edge (India) reported a 12.8% year-on-year increase in standalone billings, with a 12.6% growth in the recruitment solutions segment.",
